<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: power sampling node -->
  <CAO_PowerSamplingNode.label>供電採樣節點</CAO_PowerSamplingNode.label>
  <!-- EN: Joins the power grid it overlaps and measures that grid's net power (generation minus consumption) during a productivity sampling period. Place it touching wires or powered buildings. Only one per map. After archival, an archival power outlet replays the sampled net power at your home base. -->
  <CAO_PowerSamplingNode.description>併入其覆蓋的電網，在產能採樣期間測量該電網的淨功率（發電量減去耗電量）。請將其放置在電線或已通電建築旁。每張地圖僅限一個。封存後，封存供電端會在你的主基地重現採樣到的淨功率。</CAO_PowerSamplingNode.description>

  <!-- EN: archival power outlet -->
  <CAO_PowerOutlet.label>封存供電端</CAO_PowerOutlet.label>
  <!-- EN: Connect this to an archived outpost that sampled its power grid. Each tick it feeds the outpost's signed net power into the local grid: positive generates power here, negative draws power from here (covering the outpost's deficit). Your home grid is the buffer. Place it touching wires or powered buildings. -->
  <CAO_PowerOutlet.description>將其連接到已採樣過電網的封存哨站。它會持續把哨站的有號淨功率灌入本地電網：正值在此發電，負值從此處取電（彌補哨站的缺口）。你的主基地電網就是緩衝。請將其放置在電線或已通電建築旁。</CAO_PowerOutlet.description>

</LanguageData>
